WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.300
You came here looking for a tracker

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:08.620
Who...or what...am I tracking?

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.700
That´s a big one!

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:19.500
Before we leave this island, we are going to bring that ape down.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.760
We are all gonna die together out here.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.340
You shouldn´t have come here.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.800
Kong Skull Island, Rated PG 13

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.080
Experience it in an IMAX March 10th

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:37.640
It´s a survey job. Just chopper them in and out.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.080
It´ll be a joyride.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.520
You are going to tell me everything I don´t know

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.560
or I´m gonna blow your head off.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.100
This planet doesn´t belong to us.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:43.520
Ancient species owned this Earth long before mankind.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.260
I spent 30 years trying to prove the truth.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:52.400
Monsters exist.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:59.540
You don´t go into someone´s house, unless you are picking a fight

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.160
What you're looking at...it's a monster

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:09.420
from some bygone era

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.380
It's time to sell that man

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.200
it's King!

